   "source": [
    "## ResNet-18 Intermediate Features and CAM\n",
    "\n",
    "The feature extractor records outputs from compound blocks during a forward pass.\n",
    "For ResNet-18, `layer4.1` is the final convolutional block and produces the feature\n",
    "map used below for class activation visualization."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9d7aa867",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Inspect Intermediate Feature Maps\n",
    "\n",
    "The extractor returns the model logits together with a dictionary keyed by the\n",
    "captured block name. The spatial resolution decreases through the ResNet stages,\n",
    "while the channel count increases. These tensors are useful for comparing early\n",
    "and late visual representations."
   ]
  },
